  $Id: dis.h,v 7.3.1.2 2020/08/17 12:10:44 mcalabre Exp mcalabre $
a83 6
* Note that, as defined, TPV assumes that CDi_ja is used to define the linear
* transformation.  Consequently, the independent variables of the TPV
* polynomial are intermediate world coordinates rather than intermediate pixel
* coordinates.  Thus, unlike other sequent distortions, if PCi_ja is used
* instead of CDi_ja, then CDELTja must be applied before the TPV polynomial.
*
